error: `#[schema(open)]` may appear once per container object: it supplies that object's `unevaluatedProperties`, which is one keyword, so a second open field could only overwrite what the first one said. Merge the two maps, or give one of them a named field of its own
  --> tests/ui/macros/schema_open_misplaced.rs:22:14
   |
22 |     #[schema(open)]
